# ML-Project-20264 - Customer Service Intent Classification

This project trains a machine learning model to classify customer service queries.

## Files
- Bitext_Sample_Customer_Service_Training_Dataset.csv - Training data
- Bitext_Sample_Customer_Service_Validation_Dataset.csv - Validation data  
- Bitext_Sample_Customer_Service_Testing_Dataset.csv - Testing data
- train_model.py - Python code to train the model

## How to Run
pip install pandas scikit-learn
python train_model.py

